{"id":"n1-156","title":"Verbる が早いか (verb-ru ga hayai ka)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses 'as soon as...' or 'the moment when...'.","longExplanation":"Verbる が早いか indicates that something happens immediately after something else. It's similar to 'as soon as...' or 'no sooner than...'.","formation":"Verb-dictionary form + が早いか","examples":[{"jp":"部屋に入るが早いか、彼はテレビをつけた。","romaji":"Heya ni hairu ga hayai ka, kare wa terebi o tsuketa.","en":"No sooner had he entered the room than he turned on the TV.","words":[{"surface":"部屋","vocabId":"1499320","reading":"へや"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"入る","vocabId":"1465590","reading":"はいる"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"早い","vocabId":"1404975","reading":"はやい"},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"テレビ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"つけ","vocabId":"1495750","reading":"つけ"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"電車に乗るが早いか、私はすぐに眠ってしまった。","romaji":"Densha ni noru ga hayai ka, watashi wa sugu ni nemutte shimatta.","en":"As soon as I got on the train, I immediately fell asleep.","words":[{"surface":"電車","vocabId":"1443530","reading":"でんしゃ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"乗る","vocabId":"1355120","reading":"のる"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"早い","vocabId":"1404975","reading":"はやい"},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すぐ","vocabId":"1430610","reading":"すぐ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"眠っ","vocabId":"1529390","reading":"ねむる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しまっ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"彼女が見るが早いか、すぐに泣き始めた。","romaji":"Kanojo ga miru ga hayai ka, sugu ni naki hajimeta.","en":"The moment she looked, she began to cry.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"見る","vocabId":"1259290","reading":"みる"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"早い","vocabId":"1404975","reading":"はやい"},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すぐ","vocabId":"1430610","reading":"すぐ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"泣き","vocabId":"1229650","reading":"なき"},{"surface":"始め","vocabId":"1342540","reading":"はじめ"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"給料をもらうが早いか、全て使い果たしてしまった。","romaji":"Kyuuryou o morau ga hayai ka, subete tsukaihatashite shimatta.","en":"No sooner had I received my salary than I spent it all.","words":[{"surface":"給料","vocabId":"1230360","reading":"きゅうりょう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"もらう","vocabId":"1535910","reading":"もらう"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"早い","vocabId":"1404975","reading":"はやい"},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"全て","vocabId":"1595730","reading":"すべて"},{"surface":"使い果たし","vocabId":"1305750","reading":"つかいはたす"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しまっ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]}]}